        "text": "Ned from the UCSF Benioff Homelessness and Housing Institute finally tweeted our story — and he's big on Twitter. Thanks <@U01B9FNF801>, I saw your push to them this week! <https:\/\/twitter.com\/resnikoff\/status\/1499491572865732609?s=20&amp;t=FOo9HRkp3d6mt39jTC_SXw>",
