                "original_url": "https:\/\/twitter.com\/resnikoff\/status\/1499491572865732609?s=20&amp;t=FOo9HRkp3d6mt39jTC_SXw",
                "fallback": "<https:\/\/twitter.com\/resnikoff|@resnikoff>: Been thinking more about this great <https:\/\/twitter.com\/TheBestNuala|@TheBestNuala> piece, and how it's a reminder that implementation is critical. Permanent supportive housing is an intervention that works, but it only works if we actually get people in the units. We need to do better. <https:\/\/www.sfpublicpress.org\/in-san-francisco-hundreds-of-homes-for-the-homeless-sit-vacant\/>",
                "text": "Been thinking more about this great <https:\/\/twitter.com\/TheBestNuala|@TheBestNuala> piece, and how it's a reminder that implementation is critical. Permanent supportive housing is an intervention that works, but it only works if we actually get people in the units. We need to do better. <https:\/\/www.sfpublicpress.org\/in-san-francisco-hundreds-of-homes-for-the-homeless-sit-vacant\/>",
